# QUERYMESH - Zero-to-Elite Lab Manual (beginner edition, October 2026)
Who this is for: a beginner who knows a little Python and wants to build, deploy and explain a production-grade multi-agent RAG system. Every step is one action. Every file is created by you, in a folder you create. Nothing is skipped.
Assumptions (change anything that is wrong for you): Windows 11 laptop with no usable GPU; goal = the QueryMesh portfolio project exactly as written on your resume, which you can build, show and defend in AI-engineer interviews; budget = pay-as-you-go GPU on Hyperstack (about US$15-25 for the whole manual), free tiers for Jina, Upstash, Logfire, Langfuse, Telegram and GitHub, FakeCloud is free, real AWS is optional (about US$3-6 if you follow the teardown steps the same day).
