## 0.5 What each piece does
§ Component § Its job
§ Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 § the language model that grades, writes and checks (Apache-2.0 licence, no thinking mode) [22]
§ vLLM § a fast model server with an OpenAI-compatible API on port 8000 [21]
§ arXiv API + arxiv Python package § finds the newest papers by topic (max 1 request every 3 seconds) [10][11]
§ Docling § reads a PDF's layout and turns it into clean Markdown [12]
§ Jina AI embeddings § turns text into 1024 numbers (a vector) that capture its meaning [17][18]
§ OpenSearch § stores chunks; does BM25 keyword search, vector (k-NN) search and the hybrid query [14][16]
§ Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) § merges two ranked lists by rank, not by score [15][19]
§ Apache Airflow § runs the ingestion every night at 02:00 and retries failures [13]
§ LangGraph § builds the supervisor-worker state machine with a shared TypedDict state [20]
§ FastMCP § turns each agent's function into an MCP tool served over SSE [23][24]
§ A2A protocol (a2a-sdk) § Agent Cards for discovery, and agent-to-agent task delegation [25]
§ Upstash Redis § a hosted Redis that caches answers by the SHA-256 of the question [28]
§ Pydantic Logfire § span-level tracing: which agent ran, how long, what failed [26]
§ Langfuse Cloud § LLM tracing: prompts, answers, token counts, latency [27]
§ FastAPI + PyJWT § the API with login (POST /token) and protected endpoints [31]
§ Gradio, python-telegram-bot § the web chat and the Telegram bot, both streaming the agents' steps [29][30]
§ Docker, kind, Helm § images, a local Kubernetes cluster, and the package manager for Kubernetes [32][34]
§ FakeCloud § free local AWS emulator: same aws commands, address http://localhost:4566 [6]
§ AWS ECR, Secrets Manager, IAM, EKS, ALB, S3 § image registry, secret safe, permissions, managed Kubernetes, load balancer, file storage
§ AWS Load Balancer Controller, External Secrets Operator § create the ALB from an Ingress; copy secrets from AWS into Kubernetes [38][39]
§ GitHub Actions § tests every push; builds images, pushes to ECR and deploys to EKS on main [40]
