Jina AI key in detail (you need it first):
Step 1. Open https://jina.ai/embeddings in your browser.
Step 2. Scroll down to the API box on the page (it shows a key that starts with jina_).
Step 3. Click the copy icon next to the key (verify: the page layout changes often; the key may also be under "API Key & Billing").
Step 4. Paste it into secrets.txt as JINA_API_KEY = jina_...
Watch out: that free key holds 10 million tokens. Ingesting 20 full papers uses roughly 0.5-1 million tokens. Do not re-run ingestion in a loop.
Watch out: you do NOT need a Hugging Face account: Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 is Apache-2.0 and downloads without a licence form [22].
CHECKPOINT: you can log in to Hyperstack, and secrets.txt contains your Jina key.
